  "notes": [
    "Official realtime assistant pref_generation omitted; no synthetic acknowledgment inserted.",
    "All 6 form/task combinations and valid filler prefixes supported; only four suites initially registered.",
    "Native JSON release: 20 topics total 1000 tasks (unequal topic sizes), 24 LMSYS conversations/632 messages; one unmatched MCQ copy excluded.",
