    "Decision/gated always calls reference LLM for acknow restatement; thresholds use prefeval_* categories. No agreement study; fidelity partial.",
    "Framework character budget is additional; drops oldest messages. Default reader output limits 300 generation / 5 MCQ; remind off, CoT not implemented."
